        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus",
        "text": "But I... I'm not useless either!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus",
        "text": "That's why you have to make sure you do your job well, no matter what it takes, Monch!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus",
        "text": "You and I will sap some of that stinking bitch's arrogance together! I will show her how amazing I can be!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Monch",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Monch",
        "text": "I understand how you feel about the Browntails, Madame."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#6$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Monch",
        "text": "But in that case, you should really set your eyes on more than just the hunt."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_262_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#6$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus",
        "text": "Tell me, then. What else could we do?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_262_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#3$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Monch",
        "text": "If you trust my judgment\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#3$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus",
        "text": "What're you talking about? If I don't trust you, who else could I trust?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#2$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Monch",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Monch",
        "text": "I appreciate your trust, Madame. So please leave this matter to me. I have a few ideas... but we need to be careful. It's not the right time to jump to conclusions."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Monch",
        "text": "As for you, Madame, to make sure everything goes well, please do not tell Sir Yucatan about this affair."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_262_1#4$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus",
        "text": "Not even Yucatan?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_262_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus",
        "text": "Right. He's always in the way, treating me like a little girl. He even tells on me to Ratatos. As if I don't know..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_262_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus",
        "text": "I'll leave everything to you, Monch! Don't disappoint me!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_262_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#6$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Monch",
        "text": "Of course. Please rest assured..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Monch",
        "text": "When all is said and done, I will make sure you will get your time in the limelight."
    },
