    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes",
        "text": "What is it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Enya",
        "text": "Whether your path is right or wrong, Kjerag has its own path to follow."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Enya",
        "text": "No one can decide for all of Kjeragandr's children."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#9$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes",
        "text": "I feel the same way..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#9$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes",
        "text": "Our merits are not for others to judge. Now that things have come to this, there is no reason for me to back away. With my actions..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes",
        "text": "\u2014I did all that I could, nothing more."
    },
